{"id":51752,"date":"2026-06-19T10:32:47","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T09:32:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/"},"modified":"2026-08-21T15:57:35","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T14:57:35","slug":"epic-azores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/","title":{"rendered":"EPIC Azores 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO EPIC AZORES 2026 --><\/p>\n<p><!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre o <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">EPIC Trail Run Azores 2026 (S\u00e3o Miguel)<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A 11.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do EPIC Trail Run Azores realiza-se entre 3 e 5 de dezembro de 2026 com arena de meta em Vila Franca do Campo, Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores). Certificado pela ITRA e ATRP, cruza maci\u00e7os vulc\u00e2nicos e lagoas com vertentes de EPIC 100 Miles (167 km), EPIC 100K (108 km), EPIC 60 (63 km), EPIC 30 (34 km) e EPIC 15 (17 km). Avalia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calculadora de pace<\/a> e explora a lista de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-acores\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas nos A\u00e7ores<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">trail running<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>3 a 5 de dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Vila Franca do Campo, Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>EPIC 100 Miles (167K), EPIC 100K (108K), EPIC 60 (63K), EPIC 30 (34K) e EPIC 15 (17K)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Trilhos Vulc\u00e2nicos, Serra da Tronqueira e Serra do Fogo<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O percurso ultra de 100 Milhas cruza cinco concelhos de S\u00e3o Miguel, unindo o verde luxuriante da floresta Laurissilva \u00e0s caldeiras vulc\u00e2nicas da ilha com elevado desn\u00edvel.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 4. BANNER CALCULADORA --><\/p>\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span><br \/>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p>    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<p>  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 5. ALOJAMENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ficar em Vila Franca do Campo (Alojamento)<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila Franca do Campo \/ Ponta Delgada:<\/strong> Hot\u00e9is tur\u00edsticos em Vila Franca do Campo e alojamentos em Ponta Delgada.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Queijadas da Vila Franca do Campo, Cozido das Furnas e Ch\u00e1 das Gorreana.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 7. FAQS --><\/p>\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre o EPIC Trail Run Azores 2026.<\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>Os resultados oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis no site epictrailazores.com e no Portugal Running.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>As fotos s\u00e3o partilhadas no epictrailazores.com e redes sociais oficiais.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51753,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf